{"4468970": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Rift Protocol", "steam_appid": 4468970, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [5018460], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rift Protocol</strong> is a real-time squad tactics roguelite. You don’t control one hero, you command up to three soldiers as one entity, through a procedurally generated underground laboratory.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4468970/extras/2166f6aaa81aa8cfb2f6d6750fe33dc9.avif?t=1786470106\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4468970/extras_big/2166f6aaa81aa8cfb2f6d6750fe33dc9.avif?t=1786470106 width=1560 height=504 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4468970/extras/9f87c37f29cd1e498ea4b19362b2b6ce.avif?t=1786470106\" width=1232 height=66 /></span><strong>COMMAND A SQUAD, NOT A LONE SOLDIER</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Direct up to three soldiers with squad wide commands. Hold formation, focus fire on priority targets, or split the team when an objective demands it.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4468970/extras/fc7c2ee79a4f2c47fa560f8e2ee09077.poster.avif?t=1786470106\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4468970/extras/fc7c2ee79a4f2c47fa560f8e2ee09077.webm?t=1786470106\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4468970/extras/fc7c2ee79a4f2c47fa560f8e2ee09077.mp4?t=1786470106\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>    <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4468970/extras/9f87c37f29cd1e498ea4b19362b2b6ce.avif?t=1786470106\" width=1232 height=66 /></span><strong>SLOW TIME. MAKE THE CALL.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter Tactical Focus when the situation turns against you. Aim abilities, spend Command Points, deploy turrets, throw smoke, and turn dangerous rooms into defensible positions.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4468970/extras/f1ef1a940617fde87460dd9038529b97.poster.avif?t=1786470106\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4468970/extras/f1ef1a940617fde87460dd9038529b97.webm?t=1786470106\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4468970/extras/f1ef1a940617fde87460dd9038529b97.mp4?t=1786470106\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4468970/extras/9f87c37f29cd1e498ea4b19362b2b6ce.avif?t=1786470106\" width=1232 height=66 /></span><strong>EVERY RUN REBUILDS THE FACILITY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedurally generated sectors change their layouts, loot, threats, and objectives. Search rift infested laboratories and reach the exit before your supplies, or your soldiers, run out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4468970/extras/901abbf69980db1b2eb408822203dca4.poster.avif?t=1786470106\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4468970/extras/901abbf69980db1b2eb408822203dca4.webm?t=1786470106\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4468970/extras/9f87c37f29cd1e498ea4b19362b2b6ce.avif?t=1786470106\" width=1232 height=66 /></span><strong>HACK, REPAIR, AND IMPROVISE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not every obstacle can be solved with gunfire. Hack terminals, repair or seal doors, recover keycards, replace air filters, and carry unstable rift cores while the rest of your squad protects the objective.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4468970/extras/d3f6941e647c9dca67291afbb7645416.poster.avif?t=1786470106\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4468970/extras/d3f6941e647c9dca67291afbb7645416.webm?t=1786470106\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4468970/extras/d3f6941e647c9dca67291afbb7645416.mp4?t=1786470106\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4468970/extras/9f87c37f29cd1e498ea4b19362b2b6ce.avif?t=1786470106\" width=1232 height=66 /></span><strong>EVERY SOLDIER CARRIES THE CONSEQUENCES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wounds can hinder your soldiers instead of merely reducing HP. If the squad falls, the run ends, but a Save Soldier station can preserve one veteran for your next attempt.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4468970/extras/4c575ac3559254e5abf1a5f02e4e1d09.poster.avif?t=1786470106\" width=910 height=512 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.stea